Roke Zindan Me Yeh Kehti Thi Sakina Baba<br>
<br>
aapke Baad Gawaara Nahi Jeena Baba<br>
<br>
1. Neend Aati Nahi Din Raat Yu'nhi Roti Hoo'n<br>
yaad Aata Hai Mujhe Aap Ka Seena Baba<br>
<br>
2. Bhai Sajjad Ka Bistar Mere Gouhar Cheene<br>
kya Yateemo Ko Yu'nhi Dete Hain Pursa Baba<br>
<br>
3. Kaan Se Khoon Tapakta Hai Mere Shanou'n Par<br>
is Tarah Shimr Ne Gauhar Mere Cheene Baba<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Karbala Se Jo Chali Shaam Ke Zindaan Talak<br>
mujh Ko Jee Bhar Ke Layeenou'n Ne Sataya Baba<br>
<br>
5. Pusht Par Oont Ki Bandhey Thay Sitamgar Mujhko<br>
us Aziyat Se Hain Zakhmi Mera Seena Baba<br>
<br>
6. Mojiza Dekh Ke Haira'n Tha Har Ek Bani-e-shar<br>
aap Ka Sar Meri Godi Mai Jo Aaya Baba<br>
<br>
7. Aap Ki Beti Pay Us Waqt Qayamat Guzri<br>
us Ko Haakim Ne Kaneezi Me Jo Ma'nga Baba<br>
<br>
8. Mere Ammu Se Kaho Aake Chudaye'n Jaldi<br>
mujh Ko Kha Jayega Zinda'n Ka Andhera Baba<br>
<br>
9. Aap Aajaye'n Toh Zinda'n Me Ujala Hoga<br>
mujh Pay Ehsa'n Ye Bada Aap Ka Hoga Baba<br>
<br>
10. Qalbey Saber Ko Ise Sunke Tasalli Hogi<br>
jab Padha Jayega Mazher Ka Yeh Nouha Baba